/-!
# Degree-three triple-edge braid prerequisites

## Main results
Explicit degree-three candidates and centre-first quartic Serre identities.
The ambient rank and compatible toral lattice are unrestricted.

## References
Reconstructed from the repository quantum quotient presentation and its `T''` convention.
No external primary source consulted. These are necessary identities, not a G₂ automorphism
